# Map every author identity used in this repository onto the account that owns
# the remote, so GitHub links the commits and counts them in the contribution
# graph instead of showing an unattributed grey avatar.
#
# Format:  <proper-name> <proper-email> <commit-name> <commit-email>
#
# The commits below were authored on this machine by local agent identities
# and by an unregistered placeholder address. None of those addresses is
# registered with GitHub, so without this file the commits show as unlinked
# and do not appear in the contribution graph.
#
# This changes no commit content and requires no history rewrite.

